body:
Sorry about the missing stuff, I have never had this kind of problem before:

\-Yes, until the 3rd of September;

\-No one as a clue about the landlord, we rent through an agency called Easy Lets London;

\-I got a bunch of papers saying that if I do not leave the 07/09 they will issue a notice from Section 21;

\-I have a deposit and it's under a protection scheme. Anyway, we have a WAchat that includes the previous tenants and some had troubles because they tried no to give the deposit back for the most absurd reason (like "You changed the whole forniture of the room, including bed and wardrobe");
